     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "The second failure mode is related. When a single agent is connected to many tools to handle diverse tasks, the tool descriptions themselves consume context window space. More critically, the model's routing accuracy decreases as the number of tools increases.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
